hrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"grjFEAN9gXOKQFEta4yBJg","review_id":"drHCAjQ7eneS9d8oo_jxdg","date":"2020-01-08T11:22:12","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9463516473770142,"text_excerpt":"The hand grenades are the bomb! Yes, it may be a little touristy but it's worth it. My husband and I went to NOLA for New Year's and stayed right across the street from Tropical Isle on Bourbon. It was great. It was packed because of New Year but it is a great place to go to get drunk or a really good buzz. They are known for their Shark Attack drink and the Hand Grenades. I didn't have their Shark Attack but I had their hand grenades. I had both on the rocks and frozen. Both were good but they say you get drunker with on the rocks. I had each on different days. I was already tipsy when I was drinking the frozen so this certainly sent me over. Lol! *shrugs* However the day I had on the ro..."},{"business_id":"grjFEAN9gXOKQFEta4yBJg","review_id":"kBc9ZCmhSkVcAk3Zahj6OA","date":"2017-12-21T19:32:49","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9413767457008362,"text_excerpt":"Home of the original \"Hand Grenade\" I had mine frozen but you can also get it on the rocks but it tastes different to me. It's some sort of melony goodness lol. I went to 2 of them along Bourbon St. - 1 had live music and the other had a DJ playing more current music so you can pick what you like. Bartenders are quick to acknowledge you. You can sample before you choose. Hand Grenades come in a special souvenir container. Keep it for a discount on a refill at other Tropical Isles in the French Quarters. It's a full bar so other drinks can be ordered as well. I went through the week and had a good time so I can only imagine what a weekend is like."},{"business_id":"grjFEAN9gXOKQFEta4yBJg","review_id":"nvpt0zuetLMWQHqaNFQ3HQ","date":"2019-05-05T14:00:50","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9354511499404907,"text_excerpt":"Yeah it's a tourist trap but it's worth a stop to enjoy a Hand Grenade on Bourbon St. The drink is tasty and pretty sweet but don't drink it too fast or you'll regret it! We stayed here for a while and enjoyed the live band which accepted song requests via a message tube like they have in the drive in line at the bank. Fun place and worth a try."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"grjFEAN9gXOKQFEta4yBJg","photo_id":"JMPnpF5KRoquSXEtPQXW-g","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/JMPnpF5KRoquSXEtPQXW-g.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9154888987541199},{"business_id":"grjFEAN9gXOKQFEta4yBJg","photo_id":"ViQdz0ugpfJmL9yZlBuSwg","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/ViQdz0ugpfJmL9yZlBuSwg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8595185279846191},{"business_id":"grjFEAN9gXOKQFEta4yBJg","photo_id":"5FH1kFriIWgZG462VWNLRQ","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/5FH1kFriIWgZG462VWNLRQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.834550142288208},{"business_id":"grjFEAN9gXOKQFEta4yBJg","photo_id":"gOMdDvnpqlFUyjMB5K0cwA","label":"drink","image_url":"/photos/gOMdDvnpqlFUyjMB5K0cwA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8276647925376892},{"business_id":"grjFEAN9gXOKQFEta4yBJg","photo_id":"WcnUXkqM-VqPX-BWxyoJAg","label":"drink","image_url":"/photos/WcnUXkqM-VqPX-BWxyoJAg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7541331648826599}]},"notebook_case":null}
